            <RURComments xml:space="preserve">
                <airSeal>At the time of the assessment, we notice air leakage on the followings:

-Attic hatch

-Main floor front window (wood)

-Receptacles

-Electrical Panel

-Header joist

-Woodstove chimney

-Pony wall junction with the foundation wall

-Back door

</airSeal>
                <mainWalls>We recommend to increase the level of insulation of the exterior walls to meet the city standard of R-28. </mainWalls>
                <ceilings>At the time of the inspection the attic insulation was R-12. We recommend adding insulation to meet the city standard of R-60.</ceilings>
                <windows>We recommend changing the front wood window for an Energy Star product, suited for the northern region.</windows>
            </RURComments>
